1
00:00:00,304 --> 00:00:04,184
(Sheldon:)It was only to keep our core
body temperatures from plummeting.

2
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:08,270
(Howard:)-He's speaking about it.
-For me it was a bonding moment.

3
00:00:13,275 --> 00:00:15,985
(Howard:)Sheldon, you remember
the first few weeks...

4
00:00:16,153 --> 00:00:19,743
(Howard:)...we were looking for magnetic monopoles
and not finding anything...

5
00:00:19,907 --> 00:00:23,157
(Howard:)...and you were acting
like an obnoxious giant dictator?

6
00:00:23,327 --> 00:00:25,367
I thought we were gonna be gentle
with him.

7
00:00:25,537 --> 00:00:28,667
That's why I added the "tator."

8
00:00:32,503 --> 00:00:34,883
And when we finally got
our first positive data...

9
00:00:35,047 --> 00:00:36,337
(Howard:)...you were so happy.

10
00:00:36,507 --> 00:00:41,557
(Sheldon:)Oh, yes. In the world of emoticons,
I was colon, capital D.

11
00:00:47,059 --> 00:00:49,939
Well, ahem, in actuality,
what your equipment detected...

12
00:00:50,104 --> 00:00:53,944
(Howard:)...wasn't so much evidence
of paradigm-shifting monopoles...

13
00:00:54,108 --> 00:01:01,018
...as it was static from the electric
can opener we were turning on and off.

